==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Prof. Wild Base (Enemy Base)|Prof. Wild Base]].
*1 [[Hater]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**5 [[Hater]]s spawn, delay 10.67~21.33 seconds<sup>320f~640f</sup>.
**7 [[Hater]]s spawn, delay 5.33~10.67 seconds<sup>160f~320f</sup>.
**10 [[Hater]]s spawn, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite being spammed, these haters can be taken out very easily with Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]]. They pose very little threat, and even provide you with ample cash!

